# OperateFlow — Project Foundations

## Product
- Build an interactive management demonstration of OperateFlow, an AI-powered enterprise delivery coordination platform.
- Treat `docs/demo-blueprint.md` as the functional specification.
- Preserve the approved five-stage lifecycle.
- Do not introduce new product features or architectural commitments without approval.

## Simulation Boundaries
- This is a frontend-only concept simulation.
- Use fictional data and scripted AI responses.
- No real LLM calls, backend services, databases, authentication, ServiceNow, Jira, Teams, Outlook, or calendar integrations.
- All external actions must be clearly represented as simulated.
- Use shared simulation state so screens remain consistent.

